{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"n1","type":"text","x":0,"y":-260,"width":1320,"height":150,"text":"🗺  AIM 2 — ASM TITRATION DECISION FLOW\n\nRead top→bottom. The SPINE (top) is the flow; the TABLES (below) are the detail it points to (①②③④).\nColour = direction:  🟢 stay/continue   🟡 watch / slow / labs   🟠 hold / add a med   🔴 switch / urgent.\nGenerated VIEW — edit flow_source.json or titration_thresholds.json, then run build_canvas.py. Never hand-edit this canvas.","color":"6"},
		{"id":"n2","type":"text","x":0,"y":110,"width":260,"height":130,"text":"①  START\nInterval check-in (survey)\n\nSeizures since last visit?\nSide effects? Which phase?","color":"5"},
		{"id":"n3","type":"text","x":320,"y":-40,"width":220,"height":70,"text":"NO SEIZURES","color":"4"},
		{"id":"n4","type":"text","x":320,"y":260,"width":220,"height":70,"text":"BREAKTHROUGH\nSEIZURE(S)","color":"2"},
		{"id":"n7","type":"text","x":640,"y":-50,"width":260,"height":110,"text":"PHASE — which barometer?\n• Still Titrating\n• Adjustment — Holding\n• Steady State","color":"6"},
		{"id":"n8","type":"text","x":960,"y":-50,"width":260,"height":110,"text":"→ look up action in\nTABLE ①  (No-Seizures matrix)\nby phase × side-effect level","color":"4"},
		{"id":"n11","type":"text","x":640,"y":250,"width":260,"height":90,"text":"Triage urgency\n→ TABLE ②  (per seizure type)","color":"2"},
		{"id":"n13","type":"text","x":960,"y":200,"width":260,"height":90,"text":"NON-URGENT\n→ med-management (TABLE ①)\n→ if dose change weighed: TABLE ④","color":"4"},
		{"id":"n14","type":"text","x":960,"y":335,"width":260,"height":90,"text":"URGENT\n→ safety flag to physician\n→ thresholds: TABLE ③","color":"1"},
		{"id":"g17","type":"group","label":"DECISION SPINE  (start here)","x":-34,"y":-136,"width":1288,"height":595,"color":"5"},
