		{"id":"n45","type":"text","x":0,"y":1214,"width":1280,"height":96,"text":"* Uneven dosing OK for: clobazam, valproic acid, carbamazepine, oxcarbazepine — within 30/70 to 40/60, easiest dose form.\n\n† Labs by drug: VPA→CBC/CMP/LFTs/ammonia/level • CBZ→CBC/CMP/LFTs/level • OXC→CBC/CMP/LFTs/level • TPM→CBC/CMP/level • ZNS→CBC/CMP/level • ESM→level","color":"3"},
		{"id":"g46","type":"group","label":"①  NO SEIZURES — action by phase × side-effect level (read across)","x":-28,"y":588,"width":1336,"height":750,"color":"4"},
